    "note": "Hop 4 is a browser round trip drawn both ways: the app opens DVLA with the minted token, and DVLA returns the user on a govuk:// deep link. What DVLA checks in between is not in any repository here.",
    "dashMeans": "a read of a secret or key, not a hop the request takes",
