        "rows": [
          [
            "Linking verification trusts an unverified token",
            "<code>decodeJwt</code>, not a verification; no authorizer or attestation on the route",
            "A token naming an existing user, signed by anyone, is enough to be issued a DVLA linking token for that user"
          ],
          [
            "Android's DVLA link reads fields the backend does not return",
            "Android expects <code>verificationHash</code> and <code>sessionHash</code>; the backend returns <code>token</code>",
            "The link would fail on Android. It is switched off in Android release builds"
          ],
          [
            "App Check is enforced only by a flag",
            "<code>feature-flags/attestation</code>, read from SSM",
            "Whether production requires proof of the app is a parameter value in no repository"
          ],
          [
            "iOS staging builds attest with an empty token",
            "<code>EmptyTokenProvider</code> under <code>#if STAGING</code>",
            "Staging sign-ins work only with the attestation flag off"
          ],
          [
            "The chat authorizer's Allow covers every route",
            "<code>Resource: '*'</code>, with a 300-second cache",
            "One Allow is reused for any path with the same token until it expires"
          ],
          [
            "No certificate pinning",
            "Android trusts system CAs; nothing pins on iOS",
            "A CA the phone trusts can intercept traffic"
          ],
          [
            "Android release builds can be signed with the debug key",
            "<code>signingConfigs.getByName(\"debug\")</code> when <code>RELEASE_KEYSTORE</code> is unset",
            "A release built without the secret is signed, but not by the release key"
          ],
          [
            "Two alarms notify nobody",
            "The smoke-test and low-200-proportion alarms set <code>ActionsEnabled: false</code>",
            "A failing smoke test is seen only by whoever looks"
          ]
        ]
      }
    ],
